                    "url": "https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/11451#discussion_r2263641111",
                    "body": "This change masks all JSON decoding errors as 'release not found' errors. JSON decoding can fail for reasons other than a missing release (malformed JSON, network issues, etc.). Consider checking the HTTP status code or response content to determine if it's actually a 'not found' case before returning `ErrReleaseNotFound`.\n```suggestion\n\t\treturn \"\", fmt.Errorf(\"failed to decode ref response: %w\", err)\n```",
